93
00:14:52,050 --> 00:14:53,490
And as a final note,

94
00:14:53,570 --> 00:14:53,971
here

95
00:14:54,134 --> 00:14:55,278
is TrailScout

96
00:14:55,278 --> 00:14:55,959
